<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Kick</h1>
<p>Weapon skill
Class: none (no guild teaches it)
Practising it needs dexterity 40.
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre> kick (character)
 kick              (whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>Use that special martial arts kick to smash you foe to bits. That is, if you're
good at it. It is more powerful when your hands are free.
</p><p>Kick is a weapon skill, listed as kick small at the guilds; you must have
practised it to kick. Each kick costs 2 endurance, and it lands best on
someone who isn't fighting yet. You can kick another player only when both
of you have signed the book of blood.
</p><p><br />
See also:
</p>
<pre> &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Punch</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Knee</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Elbow</a>
</pre>




</div>